= Instructions

Build in glass with ice.

Add @Chattanooga 100 proof whiskey{2%oz}.

Add @Raffelli Amaretto{1%oz}.

Add @Simple syrup{1/4%oz}.

Add @Angostura bitters{5%dashes}.

Stir.